   "source": [
    "the goal is to process the patient data and find BMI for all the records that are VALID \n",
    "there are 3 types of data entry errors: \n",
    "1. Missing values \n",
    "2. Heights entered in feet instead of metres \n",
    "3. rows with wrong number of values\n",
    "\n",
    "rows with errors aren't put on the output file, and we had the function print which exams have an error. "
   ]
